      "Text": "An update for mutt is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Mutt is a small but very powerful text-based mail client for Unix operating systems.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nheap OOB write in convert_file_from_to() via a crafted Content-Type header allows attacker to OOB write when email is used as a template.(CVE-2026-107570)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for mutt is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of low. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Low",
